    },
    "talks": [
        {
            "talkId": "6784901",
            "initDialog": "678490101",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "678490101",
                    "speaker": "Ermolov",
                    "text": "Hmph. The way we're going, there'd be nothing to be done, even if the Tsaritsa herself stepped in."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6784902",
            "initDialog": "678490201",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "678490201",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "What happened?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "678490202",
                    "speaker": "Ermolov",
                    "text": "\"What happened?\" Please... as if nothing's going on. That's what those officials would like to believe."
                },
                {
                    "id": "678490203",
                    "speaker": "Ermolov",
                    "text": "The so-called officials — if they see us living like this, all they'll say is, \"Citizens, let us unite and overcome these difficult times together.\""
                },
                {
                    "id": "678490204",
                    "speaker": "Ermolov",
                    "text": "Hmph. Easy for them to say. Ever since Project Stuzha began, everyone's been tightening their belts. My restaurant's business has been getting worse and worse..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "678490205",
                    "speaker": "Ermolov",
                    "text": "Now we can't even get crystal ore anymore. Forget running a business, at this rate, we won't even have fire to cook at home."
                },
                {
                    "id": "678490206",
                    "speaker": "Ermolov",
                    "text": "But I bet those Fatui, that liaison officer, and the mayor — they're all sitting pretty with more than enough crystal ore."
                },
                {
                    "id": "678490207",
                    "speaker": "Ermolov",
                    "text": "Honestly, if those useless people weren't around... Hmph, maybe the whole town could hold on a bit longer."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6784903",
            "initDialog": "678490301",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "678490301",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "These drinks..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "678490302",
                    "speaker": "Ermolov",
                    "text": "They're brewed at my family's restaurant. Business has been bad lately, and crystal ore's been getting harder to come by... so I shut the place down and started selling off what was left."
                },
                {
                    "id": "678490303",
                    "speaker": "Ermolov",
                    "text": "But if this keeps up, I'm not even sure I can sell the rest."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "talkId": "6784904",
            "initDialog": "678490401",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "678490401",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "See you."
                },
                {
                    "id": "678490402",
                    "speaker": "Ermolov",
                    "text": "Bye."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
